-3-y-mantiene-bajo-vigilancia-al-pacifico-mexicano/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T21:00:00Z", "source_name": "yumasun.com", "title": "Trudy weakens to Category 1 hurricane as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast | National News", "title_en": "Trudy weakens to Category 1 hurricane as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast", "url": "https://www.yumasun.com/news/national_news/trudy-weakens-to-category-1-hurricane-as-it-moves-towards-mexico-s-pacific-coast/article_d2f04598-86db-54a5-b425-dd50189b5f4c.html"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-17T04:30:00Z", "source_name": "hngnews.com", "title": "Hurricane Trudy strengthens slightly as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast | Nation & World", "title_en": "Hurricane Trudy strengthens slightly as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast", "url": "http://www.hngnews.com/nation_world/hurricane-trudy-strengthens-slightly-as-it-moves-towards-mexico-s-pacific-coast/article_31b5ef51-bc0f-5220-8318-cc985c056342.html"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-17T05:15:00Z", "source_name": "2news.com", "title": "Hurricane Trudy strengthens slightly as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast | National News", "title_en": "Hurricane Trudy strengthens slightly as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast", "url": "https://www.2news.com/news/national/hurricane-trudy-strengthens-slightly-as-it-moves-towards-mexico-s-pacific-coast/article_6bdb02ae-e957-584c-a1ff-98d2d18a455f.html"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-17T05:15:00Z", "source_name": "santamariatimes.com", "title": "Hurricane Trudy strengthens slightly as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast | National", "title_en": "Hurricane Trudy strengthens slightly as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast", "url": "https://santamariatimes.com/ap/national/hurricane-trudy-strengthens-slightly-as-it-moves-towards-mexico-s-pacific-coast/article_c9d06fc4-a4f3-5595-86d7-4552f39fda36.html"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-17T07:15:00Z", "source_name": "asiaone.com", "title": "Hurricane Trudy strengthens slightly as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast", "title_en": "Hurricane Trudy strengthens slightly as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast", "url": "https://www.asiaone.com/world/hurricane-trudy-strengthens-slightly-it-moves-towards-mexicos-pacific-coast"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-17T07:46:13Z", "source_name": "informador.mx", "title": "Huracán \"Trudy\" de categoría 3 enciende alerta en 93 municipios de Jalisco", "title_en": "Category 3 Hurricane \"Trudy\" triggers alert in 93 municipalities of Jalisco", "url": "https://www.informador.mx/jalisco/huracan-trudy-de-categoria-3-enciende-alerta-en-93-municipios-de-jalisco-20261016-0087.html"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-17T08:00:00Z", "source_name": "asiaone.com", "title": "Hurricane Trudy strengthens slightly as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast", "title_en": "Hurricane Trudy strengthens slightly as it moves towards Mexico Pacific coast", "url": "https://www.asiaone.com:443/world/hurricane-trudy-strengthens-slightly-it-moves-towards-mexicos-pacific-coast"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El SMN prevé que el huracán Trudy, de categoría 3, se intensifique y se acerque a las costas de Jalisco la madrugada del domingo 18 de octubre. Protección Civil estableció alerta verde para 22 localidades con peligro bajo, como medida preventiva."}, "summary_en": "Mexico''s National Meteorological Service forecasts that Category 3 Hurricane Trudy will intensify and approach the Jalisco coast early on 18 October. Civil Protection has set a preventive green alert for 22 low-danger localities, covering 93 municipalities in total.", "title": "Category 3 Hurricane \"Trudy\" triggers alert in 93 municipalities of Jalisco", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(28,'flood|ES|catalonia','heavy_rain','2026-10-16T15:43:00Z','2026-10-16T15:03:52Z','2026-10-16','{"actions": ["Civil Protection activated the alert phase of the Catalonia special flood plan (Inuncat)"], "agencies": [{"country": "ES", "name": "Meteocat", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "ES", "name": "Inuncat", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "ES", "name": "Protecció Civil (Generalitat de Catalunya)", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "ES", "name": "Spain"}], "event_date": "2026-10-16", "event_location": "Catalonia, Spain", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T15:03:52Z", "hazard": "heavy_rain", "hazards": ["heavy_rain"], "id": 28, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-16T15:03:52Z", "lead_time": "from Saturday (forecast issued before the event)", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports the forecast warning and alert activation but no outcomes of the event.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-16T00:00:00Z", "source_name": "cronicaglobal.elespanol.com", "title": "Alerta en Cataluña: una dana retrógrada trae nuevas lluvias intensas, tormentas y granizo a todo el territorio", "title_en": "Alert in Catalonia: a retrograde DANA brings new intense rain, storms and hail across the whole territory", "url": "https://cronicaglobal.elespanol.com/vida/20261016/alerta-cataluna-dana-retrograda-lluvias-intensas-tormentas-territorio-trt/1003742803235_0.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Protecció Civil activó en fase de alerta el Plan especial de inundaciones de Cataluña (Inuncat) ante lluvias intensas previstas por el Meteocat a partir del sábado. El grado máximo de peligro por intensidad de lluvia es 3 sobre 6."}, "summary_en": "Meteocat forecast intense rainfall for Catalonia starting Saturday, with a maximum rainfall intensity danger level of 3 out of 6 linked to a retrograde DANA bringing storms and hail. Civil Protection activated the alert phase of the Inuncat special flood plan in response.", "title": "Alert in Catalonia: a retrograde DANA brings new intense rain, storms and hail across the whole territory", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(29,'flood|PY|ciudad del este','flood','2026-10-16T15:43:01Z','2026-10-17T09:47:48Z','2026-10-16','{"actions": ["Monitoring of river level by Itaipú", "Assistance to families affected by flooding in San Rafael and San Agustín neighbourhoods", "Evacuations of affected families", "Continued monitoring of river level, including non-riverside areas", "Evacuation of approximately 1,000 families"], "agencies": [{"country": "PY", "name": "Itaipú", "type": "other"}], "agency_types": ["other"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "PY", "name": "Paraguay"}], "event_date": "2026-10-16", "event_location": "Ciudad del Este, Alto Paraná, Paraguay", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T14:52:35Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 29, "impacts": {"affected": 1300, "evacuated": 1000}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-17T09:47:48Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports river level monitoring and ongoing assistance but gives no information on whether warnings were timely or effective.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-16T00:15:00Z", "source_name": "eleconomista.com.mx", "title": "Un millar de familias son evacuadas en Paraguay por inundaciones asociadas a El Niño", "title_en": "One thousand families evacuated in Paraguay due to El Niño-linked flooding", "url": "https://www.eleconomista.com.mx/internacionales/millar-familias-son-evacuadas-paraguay-inundaciones-asociadas-nino-20261015-838861.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-16T01:15:00Z", "source_name": "omnia.com.mx", "title": "Un millar de familias son evacuadas en Paraguay por inundaciones asociadas a El Niño", "title_en": "One thousand families evacuated in Paraguay due to El Niño-linked flooding", "url": "https://www.omnia.com.mx/noticia/445821/un-millar-de-familias-son-evacuadas-en-paraguay-por-inundaciones-asociadas-a-el-"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-17T00:00:00Z", "source_name": "ultimahora.com", "title": "El río Paraná desciende de nivel, pero persiste la alerta en zonas ribereñas de Alto Paraná", "title_en": "The Paraná River drops in level, but alert persists in riverside areas of Alto Paraná", "url": "https://www.ultimahora.com/el-rio-parana-desciende-de-nivel-pero-persiste-la-alerta-en-zonas-riberenas-de-alto-parana"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-17T08:15:00Z", "source_name": "ultimahora.com", "title": "Entre evacuaciones y el temor a otra crecida, 1.300 familias siguen afectadas", "title_en": "Between evacuations and fear of another flood, 1,300 families remain affected", "url": "https://www.ultimahora.com/entre-evacuaciones-y-el-temor-a-otra-crecida-1-300-familias-siguen-afectadas"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El nivel del río Paraná comenzó a descender y se ubicó por debajo de los 121 metros, pero Itaipú mantiene el monitoreo y la asistencia a familias afectadas por inundaciones en Ciudad del Este."}, "summary_en": "The Paraná River level has begun to fall below 121 metres above sea level, but Itaipú continues monitoring and assisting families affected by flooding in San Rafael and San Agustín in Ciudad del Este. The alert for riverside areas remains in place. The snippet does not detail the warnings issued or their dissemination.", "title": "The Paraná River drops in level, but alert persists in riverside areas of Alto Paraná", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(30,'','flood','2026-10-16T15:43:02Z','2026-10-16T14:50:43Z','2026-10-16','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "LK", "name": "Meteorologists (unnamed)", "type": "other"}], "agency_types": ["other"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [{"code": "LK", "name": "Sri Lanka"}], "event_date": "2026-10-16", "event_location": "Sri Lanka", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T14:50:43Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 30, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-16T14:50:43Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports meteorologists warning of intensifying El Niño-related flood threat but gives no details on warnings issued, actions taken, or outcomes.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T00:30:00Z", "source_name": "lankanewspapers.com", "title": "Strengthening El Niño Pattern Heightens Flood Threat Across Sri Lanka", "title_en": "Strengthening El Niño Pattern Heightens Flood Threat Across Sri Lanka", "url": "https://www.lankanewspapers.com/2026/10/16/strengthening-el-ni-o-pattern-heightens-flood-threat-across-sri-lanka"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Meteorologists warn that the strengthening El Niño pattern is putting Sri Lanka on alert for heightened flood risk. The snippet is truncated and does not name the agency issuing the warning, forecast details, or dissemination channels.", "title": "Strengthening El Niño Pattern Heightens Flood Threat Across Sri Lanka", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(31,'flood|AR|anelo','flash_flood','2026-10-16T15:43:05Z','2026-10-16T15:35:56Z','2026-10-16','{"actions": ["Evacuations of residents"], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.55, "countries": [{"code": "AR", "name": "Argentina"}], "event_date": "2026-10-16", "event_location": "Añelo, Neuquén, Argentina", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T15:35:56Z", "hazard": "flash_flood", "hazards": ["flash_flood"], "id": 31, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-16T15:35:56Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports evacuations but does not mention any warning or forecast that preceded the storm, so the effectiveness of early warning cannot be assessed.", "pillars": [4], "review": true, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-16T00:38:22Z", "source_name": "Clarín (Argentina) sociedad", "title": "Calles inundadas, ríos de barro y vecinos en canoa tras una fuerte tormenta en Añelo, la capital de Vaca Muerta", "title_en": "Flooded streets, mud rivers and neighbours in canoes after a strong storm in Añelo, the capital of Vaca Muerta", "url": "https://www.clarin.com/sociedad/calles-inundadas-rios-barro-vecinos-canoa-fuerte-tormenta-anelo-capital-vaca-muerta_0_t3B8Bf9Ebz.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Una fuerte tormenta provocó inundaciones repentinas en Añelo, con calles anegadas, ríos de barro y evacuados. El agua bajó desde las zonas altas hacia el área urbana. No se menciona si hubo alertas previas."}, "summary_en": "A strong storm caused flash flooding in Añelo, a town in Vaca Muerta that has grown rapidly due to hydrocarbon exploitation. Water flowed down from higher ground into the urban area, flooding streets and forcing evacuations. The snippet does not indicate whether any forecast or warning was issued in advance.", "title": "Flooded streets, mud rivers and neighbours in canoes after a strong storm in Añelo, the capital of Vaca Muerta", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(32,'flood|RW|rubavu and nyabihu districts','flood','2026-10-16T15:43:05Z','2026-10-16T15:26:20Z','2026-10-16','{"actions": ["Activation of simplified Early Action Protocol (sEAP) triggered by Meteo Rwanda dekadal forecast exceeding 90 mm of rainfall over 10 days in Rubavu and Nyabihu districts"], "agencies": [{"country": "RW", "name": "Rwanda Red Cross", "type": "NGO"}, {"country": "RW", "name": "Meteo Rwanda", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": null, "name": "International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["NGO", "NMHS", "international"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.93, "countries": [{"code": "RW", "name": "Rwanda"}], "event_date": "2026-10-16", "event_location": "Rubavu and Nyabihu districts, Western Province, Rwanda", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T15:26:20Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 32, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-16T15:26:20Z", "lead_time": "10-day dekadal rainfall forecast issued 10 October 2026", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item describes the activation of an early action protocol based on forecasts; no outcomes of the actions are reported in the snippet.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T01:00:43Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "Rwanda | Flood - Simplified Early Action Protocol: Activation (EAP No.: sEAP2025RW01, Operation No.: MDRRW026), 13 October 2026", "title_en": "Rwanda | Flood - Simplified Early Action Protocol: Activation (EAP No.: sEAP2025RW01, Operation No.: MDRRW026), 13 October 2026", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/rwanda/rwanda-flood-simplified-early-action-protocol-activation-eap-no-seap2025rw01-operation-no-mdrrw026-13-october-2026"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The IFRC activated a simplified Early Action Protocol for floods in Rubavu and Nyabihu districts of Rwanda after Meteo Rwanda''s 10-day dekadal forecast, issued 10 October, predicted rainfall of 85 to 105 mm, exceeding the 90 mm trigger threshold. The activation shows forecast-based anticipatory action linked directly to an NMHS warning product. Details of dissemination and actions taken are not included in the snippet.", "title": "Rwanda | Flood - Simplified Early Action Protocol: Activation (EAP No.: sEAP2025RW01, Operation No.: MDRRW026), 13 October 2026", "wmo_regions": ["I"]}');
